  "security_implications": "seed_o carries entropy for key reseeding. err_o and fips_o from the EDN request module are left unconnected, so any entropy error or FIPS non-compliance is silently ignored. This could allow compromised, non-random, or non-FIPS entropy to be used for key generation with no hardware alert, defeating the security purpose of the entropy source.",
